_:nfc7cc428d75448a8bffe4c328433f3e4b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:mode" .
_:ncf0fa45b4a234b59b3f24c1d3e2d4157b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:nddbdfefaf7494688a86d2fe6f7edbdeeb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
