<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetSubjectsOf> <http://w3id.org/rml/baseIRI> .
_:n6aa2a6a9c2794c278ff9904353ed52d1b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:encoding must be provided as an IRI.\n        " .
