_:n73f0263411a3495d8d6d6e7f2ac1c049b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLXPathReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
