_:ncf0fa45b4a234b59b3f24c1d3e2d4157b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A template (format string) to specify how to generate a value for a \n        subject, predicate, or object, using one or more columns from a logical\n        table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n1bd3f8beba1845008f7c605018d8107bb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Target MAY describe the serialization format with\n        rml:serialization to use when exporting RDF triples to a Target.\n        Defaults to N-Quads if unspecified.\n        " .
_:ne189c68a4bd94facbe6eebdaf5b3f56fb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ne189c68a4bd94facbe6eebdaf5b3f56fb7 .
