_:n1bd3f8beba1845008f7c605018d8107bb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:logicalTarget must reference a valid RML Logical Target.\n        " .
_:n11792def8c09434781cb7919f2e3c070b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:source must be provided as a string Literal.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
