_:nddbdfefaf7494688a86d2fe6f7edbdeeb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:referenceFormulation must be a blank node or IRI specifying the\r\n        reference formulation on how to reference elements of a data source,\r\n        and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
_:nffbc1debefc34c61bd747914a250bc9bb6 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the parent of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:n3d64168b2fcc4d569f4e9434e309b183b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The source (rml:source) locates the input data source. It is a URI\n        that represents the data source where the data source is.\n        " .
_:nddbdfefaf7494688a86d2fe6f7edbdeeb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:N80034dc8d76a41039f92987473c87b27 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:nf69ea5dc1f5d42c197ccf0e374431832b5 .
_:nae12bf7f2e1d4a6d8fac47bd7bc4a8e0b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:na1b7c33db485441c8fe7e48cd07d9366b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLXPathReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    A structured XPath reference formulation must be typed\n    rml:XPathReferenceFormulation, and MAY specify zero or more\n    rml:namespace properties.\n    " .
_:nfc7cc428d75448a8bffe4c328433f3e4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:mode must be specified by any of the modes from rml:Mode class.\n        " .
_:n737734326bcd4d5b98594eee078f4aabb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        One rml:gatherAs is required.\n        " .
_:n73f0263411a3495d8d6d6e7f2ac1c049b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/objectMap> .
