<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    RML Source accepts one or multiple rml:null, one rml:compression,\n    and one rml:encoding. All of them are optional.\n    " .
_:nc8ee0755b8b846c7bb7cc8fcbb5ef82db17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/childMap> .
