_:n75c0b8d607494a16ae9daeced58512d4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be an rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI, rml:URI,\n        rml:UnsafeURI, or rml:BlankNode for a Graph Map.\n        " .
_:na4f7212192db4067b8dbe4843181d161b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/Write> .
_:n191b99ba7f764b3dbc6629dfb00cf535b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:namespacePrefix must be provided exactly once as a string\n        Literal.\n        " .
